 "falsifier_verdicts": {
  "1_flip_census": {
   "attribution": "guard-ablated (inj_only) recall_all@5 == off exactly, and the ranked top-5 is byte-identical to off, although 54 injected chunks merged: the injected items alone cannot enter hits[:5] because they are anchored after their session's last base hit and the base top-5 is dominated by the top-ranked session. The flips appear only with the guard on, which reorders DISTINCT sessions into the window (so the items that enter are existing pool items of other sessions). The arm as a whole (injection firing -> guard runs) is what moves recall_all@5; the injected chunks are the trigger, not the entering items.",
